<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is enforcing a fourth curfew through Nov. 10 in five coastal provinces as violence escalates, and the military has begun its first land operation against cartels with U.S. assistance, including U.S. Marines seizing a vessel linked to the Los Choneros gang in the eastern Pacific. Heavy rain on Santa Cruz Island in the Galapagos killed one person, left two missing, and a priest was killed when a crucifix fell on him, prompting an archbishop to announce a clergy safety plan. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWk8xbVpKVVo3aDJVZjZSa2pBOXB3SnNmam5iYlltcC01aWh2Z01oNEZRNmxMcTlsbkhZV2hMc1h0NzFiLXQyNWlxNTZIZDYxQ01sYTF2TTB5X0lsMGRIVVR1Ym9SODVaOXZQc1VGeXBPYk1GaUU5NDUzMVNERWkwa0JTX1haSmMyQWFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOZUQ5dlFOcEN3MjdPWlVkS2ZISWk3WDM2MzVYeldYaGJkWWY3YkVLOWRBdHc4UzBlOWVJZ1hpNHhVRllPVkRyajhBbkVxai0tV21VaGh0UnoxNFBTTkE2cjU2eEI2TF9aR2d5MW9IU3hlcUJ0WGZUT3dGU2VoXzBydTNoVUJlTEdVcUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tempo.co English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQdFBWbnhVeC00bFhCaEJVM1pqUHY3VjdwSzF0a3N6UVVNVVdFZEc4SXQwc1VfdGd4cnNzdHlId2NEUUtxNXlXM2VxMkI2c0VEX0JtV1lBRzhQNmh4aDR6S3RQdHZfV2kzbVo5eHlIWGNaVElrTVhZMExqZlA4WFpnMGI0UzNsUHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQZmpQYURKcGR6WFV1OWJNSUg1dUtqdnlzVjNUSEVUbjBueWxFQjhQVzJ3X2tZLXh6dXBFTndLckxzSE9VVnF2RUlCcktJWW45M1pKeUhzNC1uU0JzVXBtZjlFSldxd3NWMGZCaDljaFBXSGlVYl